The [[Fancy Fencing Rapier]] is a godly [[Weapon]] available in the shop for all classes. On hit, it uses some {{icon/luck}} to gain damage for the fight, and on miss, it gains some {{icon/luck}}. Relevantly it also has relatively low accuracy, requiring 8 {{icon/luck}} to hit 100% of the time.

The [[Fancy Fencing Rapier]] is probably the highest damage-per-second [[Weapon]] one could purchase directly out of the shop, without any synergies required, although it has no further crafts or upgrades associated with it (with the exception of the [[Adventurer]]-exclusive [[Scissorswords]]). While it does have low accuracy, it will hit more often than not, meaning it will slowly consume all of the player's {{icon/luck}}, resulting in a very high damage weapon. {{icon/luck}} builds will give the [[Fancy Fencing Rapier]] more fuel and make it more likely to hit, making it a stronger weapon, but [[Ranger]]s with lots of other {{icon/luck}} synergies like the [[Ranger Bag]] and [[Acorn Collar]] may find the {{icon/luck}} consumption problematic.
